    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1131780/extras/602b82594ee8df8570ee9a9cdd473066.avif?t=1716196110\" /></div><br><br>Our Hero finds himself in dangerous dungeon welcoming him with a threat \u2013 fiend who wants to steal his mustaches. To save his pride our Hero needs to pass through dangerous traps and not get fooled by \u201cStealer of Mustaches\u201d.<br><br>- Do not let fiend steal your mustaches!<br>- Feel classic traps in a new way, their finesse might surprise you!<br>- Do you need to trust tips signs give you?<br>- 8-bit drive soundtrack.<br>- Magical amulet wouldn\u2019t let you rest in peace.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1131780/extras/4be581accb89d03d13f2f37d0852c28a.poster.avif?t=1716196110\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1131780/extras/4be581accb89d03d13f2f37d0852c28a.webm?t=1716196110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1131780/extras/4be581accb89d03d13f2f37d0852c28a.mp4?t=1716196110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1131780/extras/602b82594ee8df8570ee9a9cdd473066.avif?t=1716196110\" /></div><br><br>Our Hero finds himself in dangerous dungeon welcoming him with a threat \u2013 fiend who wants to steal his mustaches. To save his pride our Hero needs to pass through dangerous traps and not get fooled by \u201cStealer of Mustaches\u201d.<br><br>- Do not let fiend steal your mustaches!<br>- Feel classic traps in a new way, their finesse might surprise you!<br>- Do you need to trust tips signs give you?<br>- 8-bit drive soundtrack.<br>- Magical amulet wouldn\u2019t let you rest in peace.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1131780/extras/4be581accb89d03d13f2f37d0852c28a.poster.avif?t=1716196110\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1131780/extras/4be581accb89d03d13f2f37d0852c28a.webm?t=1716196110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1131780/extras/4be581accb89d03d13f2f37d0852c28a.mp4?t=1716196110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
